    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, that's reassuring. So, here is what I think. This looks most likely to be restless legs syndrome. Your mother's history and the evening pattern both fit. I can't rule out low iron as a contributor, though, which is a common trigger, so we should check.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:01",
